only direct funding to a few of the&nbsp;
highest-impact opportunities they’ve&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:05.240 --> 00:11:09.240
found in global health and poverty&nbsp;
alleviation – and why we trust their&nbsp;&nbsp;

